    "Name": "Clint",
    "Details": "Originally a cheap recon unit, but this particular Clint was rebuilt by a Pirate with a missile phobia, and it's got several hardwired AMS. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Variable Range Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
